{
  "bookId": "rewind-27",
  "id": "chapter-106",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26500001",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "少卖关子了，到底什么事，要说快说！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26500002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "这可是事关手办世界的大秘密——\n「天启」已经集齐了全部能量石，正在谋划一件危险的事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26500003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "知道了，然后呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26500004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "……然后？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26500005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "嘿，我看这些家伙，恐怕连「能量石」是什么都不知道吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26500006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "「能量石」，还真是简单随便的起名方式。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26500007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "那还真是抱歉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26500008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "总之是很严重的事，如果放任不管，会对整个手办世界造成不可逆转的大麻烦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26500009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "喂，不要像阿尔弗雷德一样随便使唤吾的人类，\n反正又是什么杂鱼清扫之类的工作了吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26500010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼第三人格",
          "text": "在那之前，能先说明一下「能量石」是什么吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26500011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "对不起，在蒂娅回来前，我们不能擅自透露这个秘密。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26500012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "哼，「异乡人组织」，我看还是改名叫「谜语人组织」好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26500013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "别会错意，透露这个情报，只是卖个人情罢了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26500014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "人情？吾才不需要那种廉价的东西。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26500015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "桑尼第三人格",
          "text": "诸位，依我看……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "26500017",
              "text": "够了，让我安静一会。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "26500017",
              "text": "闭嘴，都别吵了！"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "26500016",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26500017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "艾伦兹·珀尔",
          "text": "知道了知道了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-261",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "disanshilzhang",
          "rowIds": [
            26500001,
            26500002,
            26500003,
            26500004,
            26500005,
